WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.319 --> 00:00:31.781
After explaining the binding nature of

2
00:00:31.781 --> 00:00:36.369
sattva Guna and Rajo Guna in the
previous verses,

3
00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:39.706
Lord Krishna now describes Tamo Guna
in verse 14.8.

4
00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:42.417
Tamo Guna arises from ignorance

5
00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:45.962
and brings delusion and decline into life.

6
00:00:45.962 --> 00:00:48.882
It binds the jivatma through carelessness,

7
00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:49.716
laziness,

8
00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:53.011
and excessive sleep,

9
00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:56.097
leaving the soul trapped in darkness,

10
00:00:56.097 --> 00:00:59.142
unable to make meaningful progress.

11
00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:06.900
Tamo Guna arises from ignorance

12
00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:10.111
and further confuses the jivatma.

13
00:01:10.111 --> 00:01:11.029
It covers the soul’s

14
00:01:11.029 --> 00:01:12.822
ability to understand

15
00:01:12.822 --> 00:01:14.866
its true reality

16
00:01:14.866 --> 00:01:18.036
and traps it in three bondages –

17
00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:22.749
pramada, alasya, and nidra.

18
00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:27.462
Pramada means carelessness or inattention –

19
00:01:27.462 --> 00:01:28.254
where a person

20
00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:32.050
begins doing what they should not.

21
00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:34.844
Alasya makes a person inactive –

22
00:01:34.844 --> 00:01:37.305
even where effort is needed,

23
00:01:37.305 --> 00:01:40.183
they do nothing.

24
00:01:40.183 --> 00:01:41.476
Nidra – sleep –

25
00:01:41.476 --> 00:01:44.979
makes both mind and body heavy,

26
00:01:44.979 --> 00:01:45.855
leaving neither

27
00:01:45.855 --> 00:01:47.482
the pursuit of knowledge

28
00:01:47.482 --> 00:01:50.902
nor enthusiasm for action.

29
00:01:50.902 --> 00:01:54.405
While sattva and rajas each bring
their own results,

30
00:01:54.405 --> 00:01:58.493
Tamo Guna produces only deeper

31
00:01:58.493 --> 00:02:01.037
ignorance.

32
00:02:01.037 --> 00:02:03.706
Actions performed in ignorance

33
00:02:03.706 --> 00:02:07.418
do not solve problems – they make them worse,

34
00:02:07.418 --> 00:02:11.422
and lead the jivatma toward a downward path.

35
00:02:11.422 --> 00:02:12.841
Just as a person

36
00:02:12.841 --> 00:02:14.801
takes to intoxication

37
00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:17.971
to escape difficulties – after brief relief,

38
00:02:17.971 --> 00:02:21.266
their troubles only multiply.

39
00:02:21.266 --> 00:02:23.351
This is Tamo Guna’s effect –

40
00:02:23.351 --> 00:02:27.105
it gives temporary comfort but ultimately

41
00:02:27.105 --> 00:02:30.316
makes life harder.

42
00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:32.944
Every embodied being is affected

43
00:02:32.944 --> 00:02:36.197
by Tamo Guna in some form,

44
00:02:36.197 --> 00:02:38.366
because material existence

45
00:02:38.366 --> 00:02:40.827
itself is rooted in ignorance.

46
00:02:40.827 --> 00:02:43.788
The way to rise above this darkness

47
00:02:43.788 --> 00:02:47.750
is to develop spiritual knowledge and gradually

48
00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:50.211
move beyond the gunas.

49
00:02:54.799 --> 00:02:57.260
You may think

50
00:02:57.260 --> 00:02:59.429
you are tired

51
00:02:59.429 --> 00:03:02.056
and need a little rest.

52
00:03:02.056 --> 00:03:04.350
Sometimes this is true.

53
00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:07.270
The body does need rest.

54
00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:09.522
But not always.

55
00:03:09.522 --> 00:03:11.149
Some days

56
00:03:11.149 --> 00:03:14.986
you sleep very late into the morning,

57
00:03:14.986 --> 00:03:16.779
keep putting off tasks,

58
00:03:16.779 --> 00:03:20.992
or lie around without any purpose.

59
00:03:20.992 --> 00:03:22.785
Then understand –

60
00:03:22.785 --> 00:03:25.914
this is not rest. But -

61
00:03:25.914 --> 00:03:32.837
It is Tamo Guna, slowly taking over.

62
00:03:32.837 --> 00:03:35.548
Imagine an interview or exam

63
00:03:35.548 --> 00:03:38.885
is a few days away.

64
00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:42.722
Under the influence of Tamo Guna, you think –

65
00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:45.475
there is still plenty of time,

66
00:03:45.475 --> 00:03:47.894
I’ll prepare later.

67
00:03:47.894 --> 00:03:51.272
Then suddenly one day you realise –

68
00:03:51.272 --> 00:03:54.442
the exam is tomorrow!

69
00:03:54.442 --> 00:03:57.237
This habit of careless postponement

70
00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:59.572
leads to failure.

71
00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:03.034
Tamo Guna makes no noise.

72
00:04:03.034 --> 00:04:07.038
It enters quietly within

73
00:04:07.038 --> 00:04:09.832
and convinces you

74
00:04:09.832 --> 00:04:13.002
that you are resting,

75
00:04:13.002 --> 00:04:15.672
while in reality you are

76
00:04:15.672 --> 00:04:19.425
drifting away from your purpose.

77
00:04:19.425 --> 00:04:22.804
Your thinking becomes hazy.

78
00:04:22.804 --> 00:04:25.974
Important work gets left behind.

79
00:04:25.974 --> 00:04:29.519
The light within begins to dim.

80
00:04:29.519 --> 00:04:34.357
I have given you the gift of time.

81
00:04:34.357 --> 00:04:38.069
Do not waste it.

82
00:04:38.069 --> 00:04:41.572
Every moment spent in Tamo Guna

83
00:04:41.572 --> 00:04:44.617
steals the moment

84
00:04:44.617 --> 00:04:47.745
that could have moved you forward.

85
00:04:47.745 --> 00:04:51.416
Do not let this become your habit.

86
00:04:51.416 --> 00:04:54.627
Rise. Read something good.

87
00:04:54.627 --> 00:04:56.838
Speak with someone

88
00:04:56.838 --> 00:05:00.091
who lifts your level.

89
00:05:00.091 --> 00:05:03.594
Even a single small step in the right direction

90
00:05:03.594 --> 00:05:07.140
loosens the grip of ignorance.

91
00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:11.185
Your life is meant to be lived with purpose –

92
00:05:11.185 --> 00:05:15.398
not lost in sleep and laziness.

93
00:05:15.398 --> 00:05:16.607
Reflect on this.

94
00:05:21.195 --> 00:05:23.197
Have you seen

95
00:05:23.197 --> 00:05:27.827
how ignorance harms society?

96
00:05:27.827 --> 00:05:31.247
In the name of justice, loyalty, or culture,

97
00:05:31.247 --> 00:05:32.206
people sometimes

98
00:05:32.206 --> 00:05:36.044
act carelessly, even violently –

99
00:05:36.044 --> 00:05:39.297
and believe they are doing the right thing.

100
00:05:39.297 --> 00:05:43.634
But this is not clarity. This is delusion.

101
00:05:43.634 --> 00:05:47.347
This is the effect of Tamo Guna.

102
00:05:47.347 --> 00:05:51.100
When a person is under Tamo Guna’s influence,

103
00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:54.687
their capacity to think becomes covered.

104
00:05:54.687 --> 00:05:56.981
Carelessness gradually

105
00:05:56.981 --> 00:05:59.400
enters their nature –

106
00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:03.654
not dramatically, but subtly.

107
00:06:03.654 --> 00:06:05.698
They hold on to wrong beliefs

108
00:06:05.698 --> 00:06:07.825
so tightly

109
00:06:07.825 --> 00:06:10.870
that those beliefs begin to feel right.

110
00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:12.497
Laziness sets in –

111
00:06:12.497 --> 00:06:16.250
not just of the body, but of thought.

112
00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:20.755
People stop questioning their own beliefs.

113
00:06:20.755 --> 00:06:24.550
And sleep – a deep spiritual sleep –

114
00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:27.637
settles over the eyes of the soul.

115
00:06:27.637 --> 00:06:31.140
Then people begin to justify even
harmful actions

116
00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:34.268
as a great cause.

117
00:06:34.268 --> 00:06:37.063
True service arises not from ignorance

118
00:06:37.063 --> 00:06:40.191
but from awareness.

119
00:06:40.191 --> 00:06:43.361
So if you are passionate about change

120
00:06:43.361 --> 00:06:48.574
in society, first ask yourself –

121
00:06:48.574 --> 00:06:50.243
am I clear in my

122
00:06:50.243 --> 00:06:52.245
thinking,

123
00:06:52.245 --> 00:06:55.206
or am I reacting from a place of confusion?

124
00:06:55.206 --> 00:07:00.294
Do not mistake acting without
reflection for courage.

125
00:07:00.294 --> 00:07:02.922
When you rise above Tamo Guna

126
00:07:02.922 --> 00:07:05.258
through knowledge,

127
00:07:05.258 --> 00:07:10.138
only then do you truly help others –

128
00:07:10.138 --> 00:07:13.933
and awaken yourself as well.

129
00:07:13.933 --> 00:07:14.976
Reflect on this.

130
00:07:19.605 --> 00:07:23.192
You may feel that at the workplace

131
00:07:23.192 --> 00:07:26.696
your tiredness, disinterest, or laziness

132
00:07:26.696 --> 00:07:30.074
is only a personal matter,

133
00:07:30.074 --> 00:07:33.494
but it is not only personal –

134
00:07:33.494 --> 00:07:36.706
it is the effect of Tamo Guna.

135
00:07:36.706 --> 00:07:39.625
And its impact falls not only on you,

136
00:07:39.625 --> 00:07:42.920
but on the entire workplace.

137
00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:45.882
When ignorance takes over,

138
00:07:45.882 --> 00:07:49.260
it does not stop at missing deadlines

139
00:07:49.260 --> 00:07:52.763
or forgetting meetings.

140
00:07:52.763 --> 00:07:56.100
This indifference spreads slowly.

141
00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:57.977
When you postpone work,

142
00:07:57.977 --> 00:08:01.022
a colleague has to carry extra load,

143
00:08:01.022 --> 00:08:05.026
and the whole team begins to feel the pressure.

144
00:08:05.026 --> 00:08:09.447
A careless email, a drowsy meeting,

145
00:08:09.447 --> 00:08:12.742
or an unstated assumption –

146
00:08:12.742 --> 00:08:16.704
these are small things, but when they add up,

147
00:08:16.704 --> 00:08:20.583
problems grow instead of getting resolved.

148
00:08:20.583 --> 00:08:24.003
Tamo Guna covers your capacity
to think clearly,

149
00:08:24.003 --> 00:08:26.464
act responsibly,

150
00:08:26.589 --> 00:08:30.801
and take initiative.

151
00:08:30.801 --> 00:08:32.470
Gradually

152
00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:35.765
it reduces your credibility,

153
00:08:35.765 --> 00:08:37.767
and your potential

154
00:08:37.767 --> 00:08:41.562
gets buried in the haze of inaction.

155
00:08:41.562 --> 00:08:43.940
But the good news is –

156
00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:47.777
you can avoid getting caught in it.

157
00:08:47.777 --> 00:08:49.153
The moment

158
00:08:49.153 --> 00:08:52.782
you recognise Tamo Guna’s influence,

159
00:08:52.782 --> 00:08:56.869
you can begin to rise above it.

160
00:08:56.869 --> 00:08:59.580
Replace drowsiness with awareness,

161
00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:03.626
confusion with clarity, and laziness

162
00:09:03.626 --> 00:09:07.129
with honest effort.

163
00:09:07.129 --> 00:09:10.383
You are not made to sleep through your work –

164
00:09:10.383 --> 00:09:10.925
but

165
00:09:10.925 --> 00:09:14.929
to shine with your full potential.

166
00:09:14.929 --> 00:09:17.473
At the workplace you must shine

167
00:09:17.473 --> 00:09:20.560
with the glow of your good actions –

168
00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:25.648
not get lost in the darkness of careless sleep.

169
00:09:25.648 --> 00:09:26.649
Reflect on this.
